A cluster

The `Cluster` holds the `Ingress`, the `Web pod` and the `Worker pod`. The
`Ingress` routes to the `Web pod`. The `Web pod` sends jobs to the `Queue`,
which is outside the `Cluster`, and the `Worker pod` reads the `Queue`.
---
Cluster { Ingress, Web pod, Worker pod }
Ingress -> Web pod: route
Web pod -> Queue: jobs
Worker pod -> Queue: read
